%% Diagrama 04 - Máquina de estados del pedido
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PENDING: POST /api/orders (Tx 1 + history)
    PENDING --> CONFIRMED: stock reservado (history: "Stock reserved")
    PENDING --> FAILED: stock insuficiente (history: "Insufficient stock") / Inventory caído (history: "Inventory unavailable")
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: POST /{id}/cancel sin llamada a Inventory
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED: POST /{id}/cancel + release en Inventory
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING
        Transiciones inválidas (OrderStateMachineImpl) => 409
        CANCELLED a CANCELLED
        FAILED a CANCELLED
        CONFIRMED a CONFIRMED
    end note

    note right of CANCELLED
        Cada transición guarda una fila en
        order_status_history (from, to, reason, trace_id, changed_at)
    end note
